# Written before the shared configuration was vendored, and deliberately so.
#
# config/engineering/ holds files owned by jrmoulckers/engineering, fetched
# byte-identical at a pinned ref and hash-locked. A repository-wide format pass
# that rewrote them would break every hash in engineering-configs.lock.json, and
# the resulting drift report would name upstream as the source of a change this
# repository made to itself -- turning a drift signal into a false accusation.
config/engineering/

node_modules/

# Generated, fetched, or byte-significant fixtures. Reformatting these changes
# what the Go tests read.
testdata/
reports/
schemas/
configs/examples/
